   When your DB has products, the C# block below auto-generates the
   data array and you don't need to touch anything here.

   When DB is empty, the fallback list below is used instead.
   Each product has an  img:  field — put your image URL right there.

   Tips for the img field:
     • Unsplash URL  → "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-XXXXX?w=600&q=80"
     • Local file    → "/images/products/my-photo.jpg"
     • Leave ""      → the auto-fallback picks a matching placeholder
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

@if (hasProducts) {
